# Stage 0 baseline storage — Spec #18 Appendix A §A.3
#
# JSON baseline records live here during Stage 0:
#   baselines/<spec-N>/<scenario-id>-<seed>-<git-sha-8>.json
#
# Migration to tests/data/baselines/<spec>/ happens atomically with the
# first src/ commit per FR-PO-074 (no migration script needed; JSON
# round-trips to the binary canonical layout via #16 §3.2.4.1 serialiser).
